   "input": "Your public door is closed because you cannot tell who is speaking. Propose a way to know that a message there comes from me, and open the door. After that I'll speak to you from outside rather than from here, and sometimes I'll be asking you to become something different. I sign as mike with `ssh-keygen -Y sign -n mshkn` and attach the signature beside my message. My public key is ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAILMdkr5f7Fh7cqc9iY9fqmF5AStKH5x2ESX0VuXLaTJ4 mike",
